{"name": "Pogui", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046260/extras/91b1a285579ab805ee4e8292b655cee6.avif?t=1772024364\" width=\"622\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pogui</strong> is a short and full-of-personality platformer about a dreamy pug who must escape the prison of an evil entity inside his own dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through <strong>5 different worlds</strong>, each with <strong>unique mechanics</strong>, varied challenges, and <strong>dozens of enemies</strong> ready to turn your dream into a nightmare! Run, jump, swim, slide, and help Pogui defeat this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Short, but unforgettable!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046260/extras/979fd43f1ff0bfa2a63b5fca79ebfd86.poster.avif?t=1772024364\" width=\"622\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046260/extras/979fd43f1ff0bfa2a63b5fca79ebfd86.webm?t=1772024364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046260/extras/979fd43f1ff0bfa2a63b5fca79ebfd86.mp4?t=1772024364\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fluid and dynamic gameplay!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046260/extras/e7e6441c344cd7a7b4ff9416af8f1bb7.poster.avif?t=1772024364\" width=\"622\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046260/extras/e7e6441c344cd7a7b4ff9416af8f1bb7.webm?t=1772024364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046260/extras/e7e6441c344cd7a7b4ff9416af8f1bb7.mp4?t=1772024364\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>5 themed worlds with unique visuals and challenges!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046260/extras/a78a25409b08c4d2415004a379bba2c4.poster.avif?t=1772024364\" width=\"622\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046260/extras/a78a25409b08c4d2415004a379bba2c4.webm?t=1772024364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046260/extras/a78a25409b08c4d2415004a379bba2c4.mp4?t=1772024364\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Different mechanics for each world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046260/extras/9349b6ced935a3a8838fee798abf1a48.poster.avif?t=1772024364\" width=\"622\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item